    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682490/extras/c0c7a57edc5883baf8a019f1d387076b.poster.avif?t=1708353456\" width=526 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682490/extras/c0c7a57edc5883baf8a019f1d387076b.webm?t=1708353456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682490/extras/c0c7a57edc5883baf8a019f1d387076b.mp4?t=1708353456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>In Style is a fast-paced shooter that fuses together classics like <i>Enter The Matrix</i> and <i>Max Payne</i> to create a thrilling retro-styled hero shooter. </strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682490/extras/8a64091d55d26a270380cc95aa16beac.avif?t=1708353456\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br>Use tricking mechanics to create heroic plays, increase your score to unlock weapons and progression. Find your loadout and beat the game your way.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682490/extras/2cf356674962e580aba82525a50b38f6.avif?t=1708353456\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br>Play online with a friend in cooperative mode.<br><br>Follow our devlog on youtube for more gameplay;<br>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682490/extras/c0c7a57edc5883baf8a019f1d387076b.poster.avif?t=1708353456\" width=526 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682490/extras/c0c7a57edc5883baf8a019f1d387076b.webm?t=1708353456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682490/extras/c0c7a57edc5883baf8a019f1d387076b.mp4?t=1708353456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>In Style is a fast-paced shooter that fuses together classics like <i>Enter The Matrix</i> and <i>Max Payne</i> to create a thrilling retro-styled hero shooter. </strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682490/extras/8a64091d55d26a270380cc95aa16beac.avif?t=1708353456\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br>Use tricking mechanics to create heroic plays, increase your score to unlock weapons and progression. Find your loadout and beat the game your way.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2682490/extras/2cf356674962e580aba82525a50b38f6.avif?t=1708353456\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br>Play online with a friend in cooperative mode.<br><br>Follow our devlog on youtube for more gameplay;<br>",
